{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A wealthy aristocrat has passed into the afterlife and become a ghost. Now he must be settled into this new existence with the same level of comfort he was accustomed to. This won\u2019t be easy-especially considering his high standards...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is a bit more challenging than others in the series-it includes:<br>100 challenging Match-3 levels (if you get stuck, use the Hint button!),<br>15 skippable Mahjong puzzles (also not the easiest, but all solvable!),<br>15 skippable Blocks games,<br>8 skippable Spot-the-Difference scenes,<br>and a city to build that will satisfy even the most demanding aristocrat.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4154620?t=1763971552","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4154620/55494cc2e6d235543361efd6cdc382296685b6f3/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1763971552","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4154620/4369cbd4719e58f9546e8612a603e03e9dc09d80/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1763971552","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4154620/4369cbd4719e58f9546e8612a603e03e9dc09d80/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1763971552","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A wealthy aristocrat has passed into the afterlife and become a ghost. Now he must be settled into this new existence with the same level of comfort he was accustomed to. This won\u2019t be easy-especially considering his high standards...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is a bit more challenging than others in the series-it includes:<br>100 challenging Match-3 levels (if you get stuck, use the Hint button!),<br>15 skippable Mahjong puzzles (also not the easiest, but all solvable!),<br>15 skippab